Package: mockstudio
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, libgtk-3-0, libglib2.0-0
Description: Production mock server for building and testing HTTP endpoints
 Mock Studio is a desktop app that turns endpoint design into a real,
 running HTTP server. Create endpoints visually (all methods, path
 params and wildcards), craft JSON/XML/HTML/text responses, and expose
 them on localhost, your LAN, or a public tunnel.
 .
 It supports conditional rules, response sequences, weighted-random
 selection, {{templated}} bodies, latency simulation and fault
 injection, a live request log, proxy passthrough with recording, and
 OpenAPI/Swagger and Postman import - friendly enough for non-developers.
 .
 Published by Dhiva-Labs.
